data: {"id": "79b3dc2cfb664208-thinking-parallel_evidence-5937", "run_id": "79b3dc2cfb664208", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n1. **Pod 状态与 UID**\n   - namespace: aiops-case-03\n   - name: workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974\n   - UID: 9de01e2a-aa28-4619-947b-d99f9a8a8897\n   - 节点: node2 (10.2.0.50)\n   - 控制器: ReplicaSet/workload-5b5fc86c8c\n\n2. **Kubernetes Events（来自 kubectl_describe）**\n   - **FailedMount (x45, 持续 83m)**: `MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found`\n   - **FailedMount (x36, 持续 81m)**: `Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input], unattached volumes", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789050003970, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

