data: {"id": "79b3dc2cfb664208-final", "run_id": "79b3dc2cfb664208", "seq": 5942, "ts_ms": 1789050020938, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974` | ContainerCreating | Pod aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974 处于 ContainerCreating/Pending 状态，无法启动。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `FailedMount`: MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found (fact-f8bac518bef1) | 直接指出挂载失败的根因为缺少 ConfigMap |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `FailedMount`: Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input] (fact-ae1d1c5155a3) | 证实 kubelet 持续无法挂载名为 `input` 的卷 |\n| 3 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` 值为 1, reason=ContainerCreating (fact-8608f8001de5) | 观测到容器处于等待启动的具体状态 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` 值为 0 (fact-62e24ac596bd) | 确认 Pod 从未成功运行过，排除运行时崩溃可能 |\n\n证据说明：\n1. 事件日志（事实 1, 2）提供了故障的直接文字原因，明确指出 ConfigMap 缺失导致挂载失败。\n2. 监控指标（事实 3, 4）与事件日志完全印证，展示了容器因挂载阻塞而处于 `ContainerCreating` 状态，且重启次数为 0。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nConfigMap 'unavailable-config' 不存在 → Volume 'input' 挂载失败 (MountVolume.SetUp failed) → 容器状态阻塞在 Waiting (ContainerCreating) → Pod 处于 Pending 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是 Pod 定义的 Volume `input` 引用了不存在的 ConfigMap `unavailable-config`，导致挂载卷失败。根据 K8s 事件事实（fact-f8bac518bef1, fact-ae1d1c5155a3），由于该 Volume 配置为 Optional=false（隐含在挂载失败且未被忽略的逻辑中），Kubelet 无法启动容器，直接导致 Pod 阻塞在 Pending/ContainerCreating 状态（由 metric fact-8608f8001de5 和 fact-434b5f9edb69 佐证）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 2.1m\n├─ 问题定位: 82.2s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 38.2s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974: 38.2s (Evidence 29.2s, RCA 9.0s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 7.9s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974**: pod-volume-mount-failed, pod-imagepull-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 128.324, "metrics": {"run_id": "79b3dc2cfb664208", "mttr": {"value": "2.1m", "seconds": 128.33005094528198, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "47%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.9, "weighted_score": 0.18, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 90%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 128330.05094528198, "llm_calls": 10, "llm_duration_ms": 125796.76246643066, "tool_calls": 10, "executed_tool_calls": 9, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 1, "successful_tool_calls": 10, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 5723.376989364624, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 2231.074810028076}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 82205.1944732666, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证